  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.<br>• Cut cauliflower into small florets. Cut red onion <br>into thick wedges. Cut carrot into bite-sized chunks. <br>Cut beetroot into small chunks.<br>• Place prepped veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle <br>with olive oil, sprinkle with chermoula spice blend <br>and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat.<br>• Roast until tender, 25-30 minutes. </p> <p><br>TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the veggies <br>between two trays.  <br>TIP: Beetroot stays firm when cooked. It’s done when <br>you can pierce it with a fork.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4fa02f6e4158183d5d929d/step-96fab600.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4fa02f6e4158183d5d929d/step-b1e80810.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over <br>medium-high heat. <br>• Toast pearl couscous, stirring occasionally, until <br>golden, 1-2 minutes.<br>• Carefully half-fill the saucepan with water, then add <br>a pinch of salt. <br>• Simmer, uncovered, until tender, 14-16 minutes.<br>• Drain, rinse and return to the pan with a drizzle of <br>olive oil, then stir through stock concentrate.  </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4fa02f6e4158183d5d929d/step-232db120.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• When the roast veggies have 10 minutes remaining, <br>heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with <br>a drizzle of olive oil.<br>• When oil is hot, cook haloumi until golden brown,  <br>1-2 minutes each side.<br>• Reduce heat to medium, then add the honey. Turn <br>haloumi to coat. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4fa02f6e4158183d5d929d/step-3147eb30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• To the couscous, stir through roasted veggies until <br>combined.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4fa02f6e4158183d5d929d/step-a0e0b240.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide pearl couscous between bowls. <br>• Drizzle with golden goddess dressing. <br>• Top with honey-glazed haloumi.<br>• Serve with a dollop of garlic sauce and sprinkle  <br>with flaked almonds. Enjoy! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4fa02f6e4158183d5d929d/step-3a208d50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
